blished.** Do not invent a non-Flash V4.1 stack. Official open weights are `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash` only. The DSpark pair lane is separate: it serves the V4-Flash checkpoint `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp`, not V4.1. Qwen3.8-Flash-Next stays on `RadixArk/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4` + PLE mmap in this tree; `nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4` is the next on-Spark A/B, not this PR."},"1332":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-163","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#exclusive-stacks--litellm-profiles","content":"Qwen3.8-27B and Flash-Next standalone starts refuse Mode B and Mode C (same GPU exclusion as the exclusive TP=3 Jobs)."},"1333":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-164","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#exclusive-stacks--litellm-profiles","content":"The five MiaAI lanes (DeepSeek-V4-Flash DSpark pair, GLM-5.3-Flash EXL3 TensorFold pair, Qwen3.8-27B EXL3, Qwen3.8-27B TensorFold, Qwen3.8-Flash-Next TensorFold) refuse Mode A, B, and C **and** each other: one exclusive lane at a time. The two pair lanes use the **2-node pair** NCCL block (`enp1s0f0np0,enp1s0f1np1` / `mlx5_0,mlx5_1`), not the ring block above. The DSpark lane sizes memory with `GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION_TEXT=0.835` only - never hand-set `--gpu-memory-utilization`. The TensorFold lanes are not vLLM, so no vLLM util flag applies to them. Full profiles, images, and upstream recipes: Models catalog."},"1334":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-165","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#exclusive-stacks--litellm-profiles","content":"The Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe 30B-A4B NVFP4 ASR **Deployment** (`family: speech`, 1 GPU, port 8000) has no `manage.sh` verb, like `nemotron-speech-asr` / `nemotron-speech-tts`. Start it from the dashboard or with `bazelisk run //scripts:run-utility -- inference-workloads start nemotron-3.5-transcribe-30b-a4b-nvfp4 --confirm yes` after `download-nemotron-transcribe run`."},"1335":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-166","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#related","content":"Qwen3.6 Dual Stack"},"1336":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-167","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#related","content":"Open WebUI"},"1337":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-168","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#related","content":"DGX Spark Notes"},"1338":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-169","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#related","content":"Models catalog"},"1339":{"id":"/mcp-agent-toolkit","page_id":"/mcp-agent-toolkit","type":"page","content":"MCP Agent Toolkit","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":["mcp","agents","privacy","searxng","qdrant"],"url":"/mcp-agent-toolkit"},"1340":{"id":"/mcp-agent-toolkit-0","page_id":"/mcp-agent-toolkit","tags":["mcp","agents","privacy","searxng","qdrant"],"type":"text","url":"/mcp-agent-toolkit","content":"Self-hosted MCP servers for private web search, documentation, codebase exploration, and agent memory on K3s."},"1341":{"id":"/mcp-agent-toolkit-1","page_id":"/mcp-agent-toolkit","type":"heading","tags":["mcp","agents","privacy","searxng","qdrant"],"