","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#qwen38-27b-1-spark","content":"Dense successor to Qwen3.6-27B. Default checkpoint `unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4` (\\~23 GB). Exclusive util **0.72**, `max-model-len` **131072** first. Optional `--with-litellm` attaches `lab-auto` to this Service."},"1673":{"id":"/models-catalog-297","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#qwen38-27b-1-spark","content":"There is **no** official DeepSeek-V4.1 / V4.1-Pro checkpoint. Local DeepSeek on this lab is\n**V4.1-Flash** (Mode C) plus the **DeepSeek-V4-Flash DSpark** pair lane\n(`deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp`). Do not use `nvidia/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-NVFP4` (old 284B)."},"1674":{"id":"/models-catalog-298","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#dspark-and-tensorfold-exclusive-lanes-miaai-recipes","content":"Five text lanes ported from MiaAI-Lab recipes plus one GPU ASR Deployment. All serve an\nOpenAI-compatible API on port 8000 in `ai-inference`, all are `restartPolicy: OnFailure` +\n`backoffLimit: 1` (Jobs) with nothing auto-starting on reboot, and every lane is mutually exclusive\nwith Mode A/B/C and with the other lanes here."},"1675":{"id":"/models-catalog-299","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#dspark-and-tensorfold-exclusive-lanes-miaai-recipes","content":"**DeepSeek-V4-Flash DSpark TP=2 (2 Sparks)**. DSpark vLLM fork\n`ghcr.io/anemll/dspark-vllm-gx10:0.1.1`, checkpoint `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp`\n(snapshot required on **both** nodes of the pair). Flags: `--nnodes 2 --tensor-parallel-size 2`,\n`--kv-cache-dtype nvfp4_ds_mla`, `--max-model-len 1048576`, speculative config\n`{\"method\":\"dspark\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":6}`. `hostNetwork` plus the **2-node pair** NCCL block\n(`NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME=enp1s0f0np0,enp1s0f1np1`, `NCCL_IB_HCA=mlx5_0,mlx5_1`) - not the ring block.\nMemory is sized by `GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION_TEXT=0.835` only: **never** hand-set\n`--gpu-memory-utilization`. Recipe:\nDeepSeek-v4-Flash-DSpark-2x-DGX-Spark"},"1676":{"id":"/models-catalog-300","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#dspark-and-tensorfold-exclusive-lanes-miaai-recipes","content":"**GLM-5.3-Flash EXL3 TensorFold (2 Sparks)**. Two TensorFold ranks (`NODE_RANK` 0/1 against\n`MASTER_ADDR` on spark0, `--parallel 4` streams each). TensorFold v0.6.0 image\n`ghcr.io/miaai-lab/glm-5.3-flash-exl3-2x-dgx-sparks-tensorfold:v0.6.0`, checkpoint\n`Mia-AiLab/GLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-4bpw-TensorFold`, served with\n`tensorfold serve --parallel 4 --context 1048576 --port 8000`. Same pair NCCL block as DSpark.\nThis recipe is **superseded upstream** by `MiaAI-Lab/GLM-5.3-Flash-DGX-Sparks-1104`, and its\nDFlash2 draft is **CC BY-NC-ND** (non-commercial). Recipe:\nGLM-5.3-Flash-EXL3-2x-DGX-Sparks-TensorFold"},"1677":{"id":"/models-catalog-301","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#dspark-and-tensorfold-exclusive-lanes-miaai-recipes","content":"**Qwen3.8-27B EXL3 (16 GB+ GPU)**. Node-agnostic (no `nodeSelector`): any node with a\n16 GB+ NVIDIA GPU, Turing or newer (compute capability 7.5+), driver 570+. Image\n`qwen38-27b-exl3:local` is built locally from `k8s/workloads/qwen3.8-27b-exl3-16gb/Dockerfile`\n(pins `exllamav3==1.6.0`, ExLlamaV3 server). Context 199936, `MAX_PARALLEL 4`, `GPU_MEM_GB 14.7`,\nweights `turboderp/Qwen3.8-27B-exl3` at 3.0bpw. Recipe:\nQwen3.8-27B-16gb-NVIDIA-GPUs-one-click-install"},"1678":{"id":"/models-catalog-302","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#dspark-and-tensorfold-exclusive-lanes-miaai-recipes","content":"**Qwen3.8-27B TensorFold (1 Spark)**. Pinned to spark0. Image\n`ghcr.io/miaai-lab/qwen3.8-27b-dgx-spark-tensorfold:v0.6.0`; TensorFold serve with an MLX-4bit\ndraft `Vontra/Qwen3.8-27B-MLX-4bit` plus the `z-lab/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2` drafter. Recipe:\nQwen3.8-27B-DGX-Spark-TensorFold"},"1679":{"id":"/models-catalog-303","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#dspark-and-tensorfold-exclusive-lanes-miaai-recipes","content":"**Qwen3.8-Flash-Next TensorFold (1 Spark)**. Pinned to spark0. Image `qwen38-flash-next-tf:local`\nis built locally from the upstream recipe's `scripts/prepare.sh` (TensorFold Zig\n`tensorfold-native` v1.1.4); a prebuilt registry tag is not confirmed, so the lane never pulls at\nstart. Env-driven: `PARALLEL=5`, `CONTEXT=262144`, `TF_FLASHNEXT_DRAFTS=6`, `KV_DTYPE=fp8`,\n`TENSORFOLD_MEMORY_RESERVE_GIB=9`. Weights `nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP4-Local` pinned to\nrevision `b9ce18a6887e18c089fdea8509a33e63429a3300`. Recipe:\nQwen3.8-Flash-Next-Single-DGX-Spark-TensorFold"},"1680":{"id":"/models-catalog-304","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#dspark-and-tensorfold-exclusive-lanes-miaai-recipes","content":"Each of the five text lanes has a LiteLLM profile and a per-backend overlay, so\n`--with-litellm` points `lab-auto` at just that Job:\nLiteLLM rounded stack."},"1681":{"id":"/models-catalog-305","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#dspark-and-tensorfold-exclusive-lanes-miaai-recipes","content":"**NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Transcribe 30B-A4B NVFP4 (ASR)**. A **Deployment**, not a Job\n(`k8s/workloads/nemotron-3.5-transcribe-30b-a4b-nvfp4/`, label `family: speech`, 1 GPU, port 8000,\n`/health` probes). Image `nemotron-3.5-transcribe:local` is built from\n`vllm/vllm-openai:v0.32.0` plus NeMo Speech from main, which supplies the `nemo_speechlm` vLLM\nplugin. Checkpoint `nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Transcribe-30B-A4B-NVFP4` (NVFP4, Blackwell only).\nLike `nemotron-speech-asr` / `nemotron-speech-tts` this lane has **no `manage.sh` verb**:"},"1682":{"id":"/models-catalog-306","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#dspark-and-tensorfold-exclusive-lanes-miaai-recipes","content":"Or start it from the dashboard. Details: `k8s/workloads/nemotron-3.5-transcribe-30b-a4b-nvfp4/README.md`."},"1683":{"id":"/models-catalog-307","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#qwen36-dual-stack-1-spark","content":"Concurrent dense 27B + MoE 35B-A3B NVFP4 with MTP. Full guide: qwen36-dual-stack.md."},"1684":{"id":"/models-catalog-308","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#ray--large-models-nemotron-3-ultra-legacy","content":"Nemotron Ultra (legacy profile) requires a healthy Ray cluster first:"},"1685":{"id":"/models-catalog-309","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#glm-52-1-bit-ud-iq1_m--llamacpp-rpc","content":"**No Ray required.** Requires 2 nodes (spark0 + spark1) and pre-downloaded GGUF shards:"},"1686":{"id":"/models-catalog-310","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":"/models-catalog#glm-52-1-bit-ud-iq1_m--llamacpp-rpc","content":"**GLM-5.2 ultra (2-node DGX Spark)**: See `k8s/workloads/glm-5.2/` for the 1-bit UD-IQ1\\_M llama.cpp RPC config (\\~228 GB model, \\~8 tok/s @ 256K). Quality trade-off vs nemotron NVFP4 — use when footprint is the constraint."},"1687":{"id":"/models-catalog-311","page_id":"/models-catalog","tags":["models","inference","safety","resources","vllm"],"type":"text","url":