d-nccl","content":"Setting `NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` and `NCCL_IB_HCA` from live devices, not folklore"},"3633":{"id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl-12","page_id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl","tags":["nccl","interconnect","qsfp","mikrotik","safety","nvidia"],"type":"text","url":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl#interconnect-and-nccl","content":"Not copying `group_vars` pair env onto Mode B/C ring Jobs or switch labs"},"3634":{"id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl-13","page_id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl","tags":["nccl","interconnect","qsfp","mikrotik","safety","nvidia"],"type":"text","url":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl#interconnect-and-nccl","content":"Authoritative **runtime** values are in `k8s/workloads/*` Job YAML. `ansible/inventory/group_vars/all.yml` `highspeed_*` / `nccl_env` is **reference for a 2-node pair only**.\nThe 3/4/5-node netplans come from the declarative topology: Lab topology."},"3635":{"id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl-14","page_id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl","tags":["nccl","interconnect","qsfp","mikrotik","safety","nvidia"],"type":"text","url":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl#interconnect-and-nccl","content":"Multi-node nodes are labeled `nvidia-dgx-spark/highspeed=true` (Ansible labels role). Jobs that prefer the fabric use `operator: Exists` on that key — the value is not a speed rating."},"3636":{"id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl-15","page_id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl","tags":["nccl","interconnect","qsfp","mikrotik","safety","nvidia"],"type":"text","url":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl#planes","content":"Plane"},"3637":{"id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl-16","page_id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl","tags":["nccl","interconnect","qsfp","mikrotik","safety","nvidia"],"type":"text","url":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl#planes","content":"Typical names"},"3638":{"id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl-17","page_id":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl","tags":["nccl","interconnect","qsfp","mikrotik","safety","nvidia"],"type":"text","url":"/concepts/interconnect-nccl#planes","co