e Guard (not Compose occupancy)"},"3696":{"id":"/learn-4","page_id":"/learn","type":"heading","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"url":"/learn#nccl","content":"NCCL"},"3697":{"id":"/learn-5","page_id":"/learn","type":"heading","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"url":"/learn#why-no-auto-start","content":"Why no auto-start"},"3698":{"id":"/learn-6","page_id":"/learn","type":"heading","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"url":"/learn#next","content":"Next"},"3699":{"id":"/learn-7","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#learn-the-lab","content":"Why this lab is K3s Jobs, not Compose demos"},"3700":{"id":"/learn-8","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#learn-the-lab","content":"Resource Guard headroom in one paragraph"},"3701":{"id":"/learn-9","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#learn-the-lab","content":"NCCL pair vs ring"},"3702":{"id":"/learn-10","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#learn-the-lab","content":"Why reboot does not bring inference back"},"3703":{"id":"/learn-11","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#learn-the-lab","content":"Reading later operate pages without tripping on jargon"},"3704":{"id":"/learn-12","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#learn-the-lab","content":"Not treating ez-comfy-stack occupancy rules as this cluster's capacity gate"},"3705":{"id":"/learn-13","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#learn-the-lab","content":"This is **not** a ComfyUI beginner course. Still images and video on one Spark with Docker Compose: ez-comfy-stack."},"3706":{"id":"/learn-14","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#k3s-on-spark","content":"Each GB10 node is one GPU, 20 Arm cores, 128 GB unified memory. Kubelet reservations and Resource Guard keep SSH and K3s alive while Jobs request most of the rest."},"3707":{"id":"/learn-15","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#k3s-on-spark","content":"spark0 runs the K3s **server** and a **worker**"},"3708":{"id":"/learn-16","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#k3s-on-spark","content":"spark1+ are agents"},"3709":{"id":"/learn-17","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#k3s-on-spark","content":"GPU Operator installs drivers, device plugin, DCGM"},"3710":{"id":"/learn-18","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#k3s-on-spark","content":"Bootstrap is Ansible. Day-2 mutations go through `manage.sh` (`bazelisk run //:manage -- …`) so confirmations and capacity checks stay in one place."},"3711":{"id":"/learn-19","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#resource-guard-not-compose-occupancy","content":"ez-comfy-stack talks about **occupancy** of a Compose project. This lab uses **Resource Guard**:"},"3712":{"id":"/learn-20","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#resource-guard-not-compose-occupancy","content":"Policy: `config/resource-policy.yaml` (edit YAML first, JSON twin second)"},"3713":{"id":"/learn-21","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#resource-guard-not-compose-occupancy","content":"Runtime: `scripts/lib/resources.sh` on `start-*`"},"3714":{"id":"/learn-22","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#resource-guard-not-compose-occupancy","content":"Kubernetes: PriorityClass, ResourceQuota, LimitRange"},"3715":{"id":"/learn-23","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#resource-guard-not-compose-occupancy","content":"Floor: **max(24Gi, 15% of allocatable) per node** — not a second 64Gi tax after kubelet"},"3716":{"id":"/learn-24","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#resource-guard-not-compose-occupancy","content":"Mode A vLLM `--gpu-memory-utilization` ≤ **0.82**. Mode B exclusive ≤ **0.85**. Mode C SGLang `--mem-fraction-static` ≤ **0.95**. Never ship vLLM 0.88/0.90."},"3717":{"id":"/learn-25","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#resource-guard-not-compose-occupancy","content":"Resource Guard · Capacity planning"},"3718":{"id":"/learn-26","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"Multi-GPU **inside one node** uses SHM/P2P. Multi-node uses the QSFP fabric:"},"3719":{"id":"/learn-27","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"Topology"},"3720":{"id":"/learn-28","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"What to set"},"3721":{"id":"/learn-29","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"2-node pair"},"3722":{"id":"/learn-30","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"`group_vars` `highspeed_*` / `nccl_env` (one 200 Gb/s QSFP cable)"},"3723":{"id":"/learn-31","page_id":"/learn","tags":["learn","safety","k3s","nccl","resources"],"type":"text","url":"/learn#nccl","content":"3-node ring"},"3724":{"id":"/learn-32","page_id":"/learn","tags":["lea